CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'audio_tstamp_config->type_requested == SNDRV_PCM_AUDIO_TSTAMP_TYPE_LINK_ABSOLUTE'
#535: FILE: drivers/media/avb/avb_alsa.c:414:
